{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794565884855,"sessionID":"ses_e2b8af761ffe5CsrC8OCpOTEIw","part":{"partID":"prt_1d476440d001RW7zjPsHNgd10w","sessionID":"ses_e2b8af761ffe5CsrC8OCpOTEIw","messageID":"msg_1d4763468001x5HImYASh1o95S","type":"tool","id":"call_5dbc709418e34e88ab282edd","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md","oldString":"The hook writes a health record on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text only when","newString":"The hook writes a health record to the diagnostics sink on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text there only when"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n@@ -38,9 +38,9 @@\n ### Diagnostics\n \n Hook diagnostics are prompt-safe rollups handled by `lib/metrics.ts`. The `spec_kit.<group>.<metric_name>` instrumentation namespace emits only when `SPECKIT_METRICS_ENABLED=true`. Default off is no emission and is byte-identical to the pre-instrumentation surface. Alert thresholds for the rolling cache-hit p95 are read from the environment with conservative defaults: `SPECKIT_ADVISOR_HOOK_CACHE_HIT_P95_WARN_MS` (default 75) and `SPECKIT_ADVISOR_HOOK_CACHE_HIT_P95_PAGE_MS` (default 150). Both flags are forwarded to the daemon child through the launcher `CHILD_ENV_ALLOWLIST` so the same thresholds reach every runtime.\n \n-Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes a health record on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. A record whose answer came from the CLI's local scorer carries `degraded: true`. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\n+Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes a health record to the diagnostics sink on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text there only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. A record whose answer came from the CLI's local scorer carries `degraded: true`. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\n \n ---\n \n ## 3. SOURCE FILES\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\",\"oldString\":\"The hook writes a health record on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text only when\",\"newString\":\"The hook writes a health record to the diagnostics sink on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text there only when\"}"},"time":{"start":1794565882893,"end":1794565884855}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794565884860,"sessionID":"ses_e2b8af761ffe5CsrC8OCpOTEIw","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4764774001GC73INKysssMGy","sessionID":"ses_e2b8af761ffe5CsrC8OCpOTEIw","messageID":"msg_1d4763468001x5HImYASh1o95S","type":"tool","id":"call_5a214b8d29844196a2288bcc","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md","oldString":"writes a prompt-free health record to these sinks","newString":"writes a prompt-free health record to the diagnostics sink"},"output":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md","patch":"Index: .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\n===================================================================\n--- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\n+++ .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\n@@ -96,9 +96,9 @@\n ### Step 3: Durable JSONL Diagnostics\n \n Goal: confirm hook diagnostics persist to bounded JSONL sinks under the temp metrics root and that `advisor_validate` can read them back across processes.\n \n-Every hook run writes a prompt-free health record to these sinks, and `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1` adds the skill label and the error text to each record.\n+Every hook run writes a prompt-free health record to the diagnostics sink, and `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1` adds the skill label and the error text to each record.\n \n ```bash\n export SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1\n ls -la \"${TMPDIR:-/tmp}\"/speckit-skill-advisor-metrics/*.jsonl\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/s