{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794565897325,"sessionID":"ses_e2b8af761ffe5CsrC8OCpOTEIw","part":{"partID":"prt_1d4767909002jgF3Nb9eZpbX2J","sessionID":"ses_e2b8af761ffe5CsrC8OCpOTEIw","messageID":"msg_1d4766928001EgYzjclZpixS5i","type":"tool","id":"call_71a58e89446741409ae72ba8","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff -U0 -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md","workdir":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research"},"output":"diff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\nindex c233c6f3e7..f5a11686be 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n@@ -42 +42 @@ Hook diagnostics are prompt-safe rollups handled by `lib/metrics.ts`. The `spec_\n-Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes records only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\n+Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes a health record to the diagnostics sink on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text there only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. A record whose answer came from the CLI's local scorer carries `degraded: true`. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\ndiff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\nindex 4b24b854c9..38a618159e 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\n@@ -100 +100 @@ Goal: confirm hook diagnostics persist to bounded JSONL sinks under the temp met\n-Durable JSONL writes only occur when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1` is set; otherwise the sink early-returns.\n+Every hook run writes a prompt-free health record to the diagnostics sink, and `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1` adds the skill label and the error text to each record.\n@@ -232 +232 @@ Pass condition: rollback and re-enable need no state cleanup.\n-| JSONL sink empty or unbounded | Metrics root misconfigured, `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` unset, or rotation disabled | Check `TMPDIR`, confirm `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1`, confirm `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/metrics.ts` sink wiring, and verify rotation bounds |\n+| JSONL sink empty or unbounded | Metrics root misconfigured, no prompt hook ran in this checkout or rotation disabled | Check `TMPDIR`, run one prompt through the hook, confirm `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/metrics.ts` sink wiring, and verify rotation bounds |\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"diff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\nindex c233c6f3e7..f5a11686be 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md\n@@ -42 +42 @@ Hook diagnostics are prompt-safe rollups handled by `lib/metrics.ts`. The `spec_\n-Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes records only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\n+Each record carries `runtime`, taken from `SPECKIT_RUNTIME` when it names a known runtime and `claude` otherwise. Records carry optional `emittedBytes` and `directivesSuppressed`. The hook writes a health record to the diagnostics sink on every prompt and adds the skill label and the error text there only when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` is set. A record whose answer came from the CLI's local scorer carries `degraded: true`. Raw prompts never appear in diagnostics. Before exiting, the hook waits up to 100 ms for pending diagnostic writes.\ndiff --git a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\nindex 4b24b854c9..38a618159e 100644\n--- a/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\n+++ b/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\n@@ -100 +100 @@ Goal: confirm hook diagnostics persist to bounded JSONL sinks under the temp met\n-Durable JSONL writes only occur when `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1` is set; otherwise the sink early-returns.\n+Every hook run writes a prompt-free health record to the diagnostics sink, and `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1` adds the skill label and the error text to each record.\n@@ -232 +232 @@ Pass condition: rollback and re-enable need no state cleanup.\n-| JSONL sink empty or unbounded | Metrics root misconfigured, `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG` unset, or rotation disabled | Check `TMPDIR`, confirm `SKILL_ADVISOR_DEBUG=1`, confirm `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/metrics.ts` sink wiring, and verify rotation bounds |\n+| JSONL sink empty or unbounded | Metrics root misconfigured, no prompt hook ran in this checkout or rotation disabled | Check `TMPDIR`, run one prompt through the hook, confirm `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/metrics.ts` sink wiring, and verify rotation bounds |\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"git -c core.fsmonitor=false diff -U0 -- .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/feature-catalog/hooks-and-plugin/claude-hook.md .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/hooks/skill-advisor-hook-validation.md\",\"workdir\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research\"}"},"time":{"start":1794565896457,"end":1794565897325}}}}
